  "term": "POMC",
  "definition": "POMC refers here to pro-opiomelanocortin-expressing neurons, a type of hypothalamic neuron described as anorexigenic, meaning it helps suppress eating. In the medial basal hypothalamus, these neurons are involved in regulating energy balance.",
